OPERATION AND DATA HANDLING
---------------------------
* NTNXVision performs read-only API calls (GET/list requests) against Prism Central,
  Prism Element and Nutanix Database Service. It never creates, changes or deletes
  anything in the environments it connects to.
* Credentials are stored only in the operating system's keychain (macOS Keychain or
  Windows Credential Manager). They are never written to disk in plain text.
* The app's internal communication is local only (standard input/output between the user
  interface and its bundled engine); it does not open any network listener. Collected
  snapshots and exported reports stay on your computer unless you share them.

